     ```

**Mitigation:**
- **Chrome Protections:** **Site Isolation**, **Strict CFI**, **V8 Sandbox**.
- **OS Hardening:** **CFG (Control Flow Guard)** (Windows), **ACG**, **CET (Control-flow Enforcement Technology)**.
- **Exploit Mitigations:** **JIT Hardening**, **Type Confusion Checks (--no-sandbox-harmony-smi)**.

**Real-World Example:**
The **CVE-2022-1096** (Chrome RCE) was exploited via **UAF in V8** by the **North Korea Lazarus Group** in 2022.

